<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide gaskets  as specified in [the referenced specification for the pipe] [<MET><RID>ASTM C361M</RID></MET><ENG> <RID>ASTM C361</RID></ENG>] and  are 
suitable for use with sewage.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT></TAI><SPT><TTL>Ductile Iron Pressure Piping</TTL><BRK/>
